[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Bashan
GenericName=Bashan App
Comment=The Bashan web app in its own window
Comment[es]=La aplicación web de Bashan en su propia ventana
Comment[de]=Die Bashan-Web-App in einem eigenen Fenster
Comment[fr]=L'application web Bashan dans sa propre fenêtre
Comment[pt]=A aplicação web Bashan na sua própria janela
Comment[ru]=Веб-приложение Bashan в отдельном окне
Comment[el]=Η εφαρμογή ιστού Bashan σε δικό της παράθυρο
Comment[ar]=تطبيق بشان على الويب في نافذة خاصة به
Comment[he]=יישום האינטרנט של Bashan בחלון נפרד
Comment[fa]=برنامهٔ وب بشان در پنجرهٔ خودش
Comment[ku]=Sepana webê ya Bashan di pencereya xwe de
Comment[ckb]=ئەپی وێبی بەشان لە پەنجەرەی خۆیدا
Comment[syr]=ܦܪܘܓܪܡܐ ܕܒܫܢ ܒܟܘܬܐ ܕܝܠܢܝܬܐ
# Brave in app mode: no tabs, no address bar, its own window.
# IMPORTANT: the binary is brave-browser-stable. Brave's deb does NOT ship a
# /usr/bin/brave-browser symlink, so that name would silently fail.
# --class gives this window its own WM_CLASS so Plasma treats it as a separate
# application instead of grouping it with Brave (whose class is brave-browser).
Exec=/usr/bin/brave-browser-stable --app=https://bashan.app --class=bashan-app
Icon=bashan-app
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=bashan-app
Categories=Network;WebBrowser;
Keywords=Bashan;
# Translations for all 13 shipped languages are added in Stage 8.
